# The first run on a new data directory: ADMIN with the initial password
# must change it before anything else (F3 still offers to quit, refused
# here), then reaches the home screen.
#@ NOSEED
T ADMIN
K ENTER
T admin
K ENTER
S MUSTCHG
K F3
S MUSTQUIT
T N
T admin
K TAB
T Retro1986
K TAB
T Retro1986
K CTRL-S
S CHANGED
K ENTER
S HOME
K F3
T Y
